sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant V as Viewer
  participant M as Mermaid
  You->>V: SUPER+CTRL+M
  V->>V: Read clipboard
  V->>M: render(source)
  alt valid diagram
    M-->>V: SVG
    V-->>You: Show window
  else syntax error
    M-->>V: Error
    V-->>You: Show error text
  end
  Note over You,V: Press S or P to save
